%N A399169 Number of solutions to x^2 + 4*y^2 = n in positive integers x and y.
%H A399169 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A399169/b399169.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%o A399169 (PARI) a(n) = if(n==0, 0, sum(k=1, sqrtint((n-1)\4), issquare(n-4*k^2)));
